; Print a parser reply and return failure
;
; The common end of the parser's questions and complaints: switches to
; performing and printing mode with #R$7D6B, prints the message at HL (with the
; words the caller has pushed on the stack for its {WORD} codes) and returns 0
; with Z set, which the callers pass on as "the command was not carried out".
;
; HL Message to print: "Which {WORD} ?", "I do not see {THING} here", "I see nothing to ...", "... what ?"
; O:A 0
; O:F Z
@label=PrintReplyFail
c$7D90 CALL $7D6B             ; ActionPerform = 1, RawOutputFlag = 1
 $7D93 CALL $72D3             ; print the message at HL
 $7D96 XOR A         ;
 $7D97 RET           ;
